00:28:07.420 --> 00:28:11.939
The same God that wrote the good old book

00:28:11.939 --> 00:28:13.900
is the same God who created the universe

00:28:13.900 --> 00:28:15.739
and established the laws there.

00:28:15.739 --> 00:28:17.619
Nothing can contradict each other,

00:28:17.619 --> 00:28:23.900
because all were the creation of one single God.

00:28:23.900 --> 00:28:29.699
And therefore, for him, it was a matter of fact

00:28:29.699 --> 00:28:34.739
that Tora and Madar and science are just

00:28:34.739 --> 00:28:38.060
two sides of the same coin.

00:28:38.060 --> 00:28:41.780
But there's another thing that he believed.

00:28:41.780 --> 00:28:45.060
He was a scientist, and he believed

00:28:45.060 --> 00:28:50.140
that those who brought science into the world

00:28:50.140 --> 00:28:51.020
were not the Greeks.

00:28:54.540 --> 00:29:00.060
