00:29:58.939 --> 00:30:04.459
In other words, that there are scientific laws.

00:30:04.459 --> 00:30:10.380
Scientific laws means everything follows

00:30:10.380 --> 00:30:13.140
a mathematical system.

00:30:13.140 --> 00:30:13.640
Precise.

00:30:16.619 --> 00:30:25.140
